  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Afghan Displacement-affected Communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project action is a sub-regional advocacy and policy response for Afghan displacement-affected communities. The action will deliver a range of Norwegian Refugee Council (Flyktninghjelpen) advocacy activities in support of improved practices towards Afghan refugees in host countries and Housing Land and Property rights for Afghan IDPs and returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
